r ones say  well I can see that you are under  prepare to come here your previous  studies maybe are not enough but I also  see that there may be some aspects that  will give you some opportunity to be  admitted so you should apply here and he  said and maybe you will be accepted to  other universities so I wanted to make a  promise you are admitted to those other  places but if you are admitted here  promise me your word that you will come  here and I said okay of course I was  right I was very lucky to be admitted  here and to a few other places and of  course I had committed to come here and  I came here the first thing that I  really found out is that he was  absolutely right I was terribly  underprepared to come here and I don't  know how I made it through the first  semester I think Rick lorina still  teases me about my grades in the first  semester  so but we prepare I was about anyways I  saw by the first semester and maybe did  a little bit well afterwards and  eventually got my my PhD here but the  reason why I got the PhD is because I  finished my dissertation but it was also  an adventure I had left after four years  went back to work at Mexico Central Bank  and I was sort of lazy about finishing  you know being a natural and how you say  procrastinator can finish my  dissertation one day my senior advisor  calm in Mexico and said you know Ernesto  I'm here in Mexico City I want to invite  you to a meal that to have dinner and  say great let's go and have dinner we  had a nice dinner in the sauna Rosa in  Mexico City and after the dinner he said  Ernesto you haven't finished your  dissertation right you know I haven't  it's a well you know is very simple this  is the end of January 1981 if you don't  show up in New Haven with a full  manuscript of your dissertation by April  30 you will stop being my friend one of  my favorite the students and I will make  sure that you get all over the world  very bad publicity and this in front of  my wife  I was here 